      "text": "At 6:30 am, private transport to the airport to take the first flight to Sucre. The flight lasts 35 minutes. OB 580 VVI – SRE 08:35h-09:20h. Upon arrival at Sucre airport, we will take our transport to the city. Enjoy a free afternoon to explore this beautiful city. Night at Hotel de Su Merced."
